  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To use this template, copy the following code and fill in the appropriate fields.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Syntax\">Syntax</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre>{{infobox character\n | title         = \n | image         = [e.g. \"Example.jpg\"]\n | imagewidth    = [e.g. \"150\"] [default: 210 pixels]\n | imagecaption  = \n | position      =\n | age           =\n | status        =\n | height        =\n | weight        =\n}}\n</pre>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Samples\">Samples</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre>{{infobox character\n | title         = Flowa\n | image         = Example.jpg\n | imagecaption  = Flowa, at rest\n | position      = Legal Secretary\n | age           = 2 months\n | status        = Active\n | height        = 5 inches\n | weight        = 20 grams\n}}\n</pre>\n<p>Results in...\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikia-infobox\">\n\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"wikia-infobox-header\" colspan=\"2\">Flowa\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wikia-infobox-image\" colspan=\"2\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ucp-internal-test-starter-commons/images/a/a9/Example.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200817123015\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Flowa, at rest\"><img alt=\"Flowa, at rest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ucp-internal-test-starter-commons/images/a/a9/Example.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20200817123015\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"210\" height=\"210\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Example.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Example.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wikia-infobox-caption\" colspan=\"2\">Flowa, at rest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><div class=\"wikia-infobox-section-header\">Vital statistics</div>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Position\n</th>\n<td>Legal Secretary\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Age\n</th>\n<td>2 months\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Status\n</th>\n<td>Active\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\"><div class=\"wikia-infobox-section-header\">Physical attributes</div>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Height\n</th>\n<td>5 inches\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Weight\n</th>\n<td>20 grams\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-size:0; line-height:0;\">\n<th style=\"width:50%; padding:0\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:50%; padding:0\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119205359\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.008 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.010 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 57/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 811/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 114/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 534/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.234      1 Template:Infobox_character\n100.00%    2.234      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.10_prod_secondrenaissance:pcache:idhash:68-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20261119205359 and revision id 68. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>",
